  "steps": [
    "Cook the raspberries with the sugar and lemon juice, thicken with the cornstarch, then cool and freeze in small portions.",
    "Melt the white chocolate with 35 g cream. Whip the 200 ml cream with the condensed milk and vanilla, then fold in the chocolate.",
